<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALIAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $2.3 million Italian Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>10-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 6-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 7-6 (7-5) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) beat Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-3 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>Doubles:</p>
<p>5-Byron Black (Zimbabwe)/Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat 7-Rick Leach (U.S.)/Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>3-Mark Knowles (Bahamas)/Daniel Nestor (Canada) beat Sandon Stolle (Australia)/Cyril Suk (Czech Republic) 7-6 (8-6) 7-6 (7-1)</p>
</text>
